---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How VentRunCheck handles affiliate links and PENDING referral placeholders."
>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>
    Some links on VentRunCheck may become affiliate links. Until programs are approved, referral
    parameters are placeholders only: <code>?ref=PENDING</code>. We do not invent real affiliate IDs.
  </p>
  <p>
    If a link is later activated and you purchase through it, we may earn a commission at no
    additional cost to you. Recommendations emphasize product and service <strong>types</strong>
    (for example brush kits or metal transition duct), not paid hard-sell brand placements.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is a fire-code inspection, insurance guarantee, or professional safety
    certification. If you smell burning, stop using the dryer and get qualified help.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
